🟠 api in shop (prod-eu-1) keeps running out of memory. Its node and registry are healthy and unchanged, so nothing outside it points to a cause. Its memory rose steadily from 200Mi to 512Mi over three hours before the kill. Its last run lasted three hours; four restarts since its pod was created one hour ago. Fix in: deployment/api → container app → resources.limits.memory (512Mi). To read the output of the last crash, run kubectl logs api-d461a92b-a -c app -n shop --previous
🟠 api in shop (prod-eu-1) keeps running out of memory.
| 🟠 **api** in **shop** (**prod-eu-1**) keeps running out of memory.
| Its node and registry are healthy and unchanged, so nothing outside it points to a cause.
| Its memory rose steadily from 200Mi to 512Mi over three hours before the kill.
| Its last run lasted three hours; four restarts since its pod was created one hour ago.
| Fix in: deployment/api → container app → resources.limits.memory (512Mi).
| To read the output of the last crash, run
| ```
| kubectl logs api-d461a92b-a -c app -n shop --previous
